OL,3,GNEWSAFamily pay tribute to 'devoted
OL,4,Amummy with heart of gold' who died in
OL,5,Acrash
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe family of a woman who died in a
OL,8,Fthree-car crash in Fife have described
OL,9,Fher as "a devoted mummy" who had "a
OL,10,Fheart of gold".
OL,12,FAisha Kempson, 24, from Cardenden, was
OL,13,Fpronounced dead at the scene of the
OL,14,Fcollision on the A92 near Luthrie
OL,15,Fjunction in the early hours of Sunday 4
OL,16,FOctober.
OL,18,FThe mother-of-two was a passenger in an
OL,19,FAudi A3. Two other cars, a grey Volvo
OL,20,FV40 and a white Honda HRV, were also
OL,21,Finvolved.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
